# pthread-stubs: satisfied natively.
#
# Upstream's libpthread-stubs exists for systems whose libc does NOT contain
# the pthread symbols: it supplies weak no-op stubs so a library can call them
# unconditionally.  LikeOS builds pthreads INTO libc (there is no separate
# libpthread), so there is nothing to stub and nothing to link — which is
# precisely the case upstream also handles by installing an empty .pc.
#
# Declaring it here rather than porting the package keeps libxcb's dependency
# check honest: the requirement genuinely is met.

Name: pthread-stubs
Description: Meta-package for pthread symbols, provided by libc on this system
Version: 0.5
Libs:
Cflags:
